  "steps": [
    "Rinse the dal until the water runs clear and pressure-cook with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for 3 whistles.",
    "Whisk the cooked dal and loosen with hot water until it is a pourable soup-like consistency.",
    "Heat the ghee in a small pan and add cumin seeds, hing and garlic; fry until the garlic turns light golden.",
    "Add green chilli and ginger paste, then the tomato, and cook until it collapses.",
    "Stir in the chilli powder and immediately pour this tempering over the dal.",
    "Simmer for 3-4 minutes, then finish with lemon juice and coriander."
  ]
